# Choose Your Effort Level: Tailored Services for Tiny Patio / Balcony Farming

We offer tiered service packages tailored to your lifestyle, all designed for tiny pation / balcony setups. Our ecosystem includes a companion app (with AR overlays for setup guidance), drone delivery or global courier integration - for seamless module swaps. Pricing starts at ¥400/month for basics, scaling with effort level and customization. All services include 24/7 AI support and predictive maintenance alerts. Select one below to get started.

